      "raw": "<p>Maybe TTS is a little over the top for a Pen-and-Paper style RPG.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you want the full package, we have a few roll20-tools by <strong>theDissilent</strong> here:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>https://forum.greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/new-roll20-character-sheet-22932</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And there is also a very handy GM helper app by <strong>Drezzinator</strong>, made for easy&nbsp;use with a simple shared screen&nbsp;- here:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>https://forum.greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/scrpg-gm-management-web-app-fanmade-23449</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Either of these should have you covered, depending on what you are looking for in your group.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Happy playing!</p>",
